{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026gENZWYBg4c1794364306.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>TVB節目巡禮2027最新片花，重磅揭曉多項為迎接 TVB 60 周年而打造的特備綜藝節目。當中包括王牌音樂節目《中年好聲音5》、結合經典影視IP的演技競賽真人騷《藝員訓練班》，以及集結跨時代巨星的音樂盛事《勁歌金曲演唱會》，陣容相當鼎盛。</p><p>音樂王牌《中年好聲音》邁入第五季，一直陪伴參賽者於舞台上開啟「第二人生」。《中年好聲音5》將迎來全新競賽賽制與全新評審陣容，繼續為全港中年音樂愛好者提供追夢舞台。</p><p><p><img alt=\"1375eee1-65e9-4051-bbad-f5ccd5f1abe2.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026K52psSoErU1794364305.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>全新特備節目《藝員訓練班》打破傳統框架，首度將藝訓班考驗轉化為大規模演技競賽真人騷。節目結合 TVB 歷年經典影視 IP，由曾志偉親自擔任主考官，安排 TVB 現役藝人與全球海選素人同台競技，選拔新一代影視傳奇。</p><p><p><img alt=\"90548300-6199-43cc-90f2-7715699a5d30.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Rcjcou3eFa1794364304.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"4e670341-ad02-41a5-b750-bcc4036e39f9.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20269LIwRmj7eT1794364304.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>TVB 將隆重舉辦大型音樂盛宴《勁歌金曲演唱會》，重溫由六、七十年代劇集經典歌曲、八、九十年代金曲盛世至千禧年後的勁歌金曲。節目破天荒集結全台歌手藝人、跨時代重磅巨星及內地頂流歌手同台獻唱。大會更特別預告提供全新觀賽體驗，VIP 貴賓屆時可於現場一邊觀賞頂級演唱會，一邊享用星級餐飲服務，打造視覺與味覺的雙重盛宴。</p><p><p><img alt=\"699034ca-0036-4f3c-82a5-9333523f3f03.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026m4rQrs9fYo1794364303.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T03:51:43.085853+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":467,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T02:34:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T16:34:39.701235+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T03:45:09.986550+00:00","content_hash":"6dd3dda1a5e461d61edd96b5ec78ade9e9fff73ca414b4221e95bfe49461db41","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T03:51:43.085853+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}